Will finally execute if System.exit(0) is called inside try?

```java
public class Test2 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            System.out.println("Inside try");
            System.exit(0);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            System.out.println("Inside catch");
        } finally {
            System.out.println("Inside finally");
        }
    }
}
```

